scenario: The bear comes too close, then backs off
id: arch1.bear-deterred
kind: nominal
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: The bear enters the safe perimeter: light and sound scare it off; it backs off and the drone tracks it again.
description: 1 - Mission orchestrator, autonomous features. One moment of the mission; what leads there is in its preconditions.
author: MBSE Shepherd, Part 3
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 1
given: arch1.bear-enters

phase Predator response

  step too-close: pasture sends Predator entering safe perimiter
    note: The bear enters the safe perimeter: the feature deters it on its own, the orchestrator does not move.
    then soi.pd is Deterring
    then soi.orch is Predator Defense Active
    then message Light burst
    then message Sound burst

  step backs-off: pasture sends Predator leaving safe perimiter
    note: The bear backs off: back to tracking, still decided by the feature.
    then soi.pd is Tracking Predator
